          "id": "7424c6b74be977e4fabea78a650470fadbb07a68",
          "message": "build(gui): sync optional text/rsp wasm bundles (sq-9ifq4) [HAIKU-4.5] (#1512)\n\nExtend gui/app/scripts/sync-wasm.mjs to optionally copy sparq-text-wasm\nand sparq-rsp-wasm bundles (from crates/*/pkg into public/wasm/*/), exactly\nlike the existing W-reason bundle. Bundles stay OPTIONAL (warn-and-skip when\nabsent); the lean core bundle untouched.\n\nAdd build:text-wasm and build:rsp-wasm steps to gui.yml jobs that already\nrun build:reason-wasm (gui-app export + gui-mock-ipc Playwright lane),\nmirroring the existing reason-wasm step comments.\n\nAcceptance: node gui/app/scripts/sync-wasm.mjs succeeds in both states\n(with/without pkg/ dirs present); gui.yml + pages.yml pass actionlint.\n\n🤖 SPARQ agent\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
